`benchmark.meta description: Runs grid point containment checks against closed paths.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: graphics,compile-timing

/graphics/path
/graphics/point
/graphics/shapes
/math

. paths [Path]
for i in 0 .. < 36
    . f = i as Float
    paths += circle((60 + f * 3, 70 + f * 2), 30 + (f % 9))

. checksum = 0 as Size
for path in paths
    for x in 0 .. < 120 by 4
        for y in 0 .. < 120 by 4
            if path.contains((x as Float, y as Float))
                checksum += x + y + path.count

-- "bench-result graphics/path-contains-grid checksum=$checksum"
